  ```
  x = [[[ [1],   [2],  [5],  [6]],
        [ [3],   [4],  [7],  [8]],
        [ [9],  [10], [13],  [14]],
        [ [11], [12], [15],  [16]]]]

  ```

  Args:
    input: A `Tensor`.
    block_size: An `int` that is `>= 2`.
